  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "What is missing from the statement below?\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{8}\\times 16=7\\times \\bbox[2pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}÷\\bbox[2pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Interpreting the fraction as division, we can write our expression as:\n\n$$\n7÷8\\times 16\n$$\n\nWe can write an equivalent expression by swapping the $÷8$ and the $\\times 16:$\n\n$$\n7\\times 16÷8\n$$",
